        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Sinclair Broadcast Group, ZGS Communications\n- Products: WJAR, WRIW-CD, NBC 10\n- Places: Rhode Island, Bristol County, Massachusetts, Providence, Cranston\n- Concepts: NBC affiliation, Telemundo affiliation, television station ownership\n\nFacts:\n- WJAR, more commonly known as NBC 10, is the NBC-affiliated television station for Rhode Island and Bristol County, Massachusetts, and it is licensed to Providence.\n- WJAR is owned by Sinclair Broadcast Group.\n- WJAR shares studios on Kenney Drive in Cranston with WRIW-CD, a Telemundo affiliate owned by ZGS Communications.\n- Sinclair Broadcast Group is an American telecommunications company.\n- Sinclair Broadcast Group is owned by the family of company founder Julian Sinclair Smith.",
